  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</a></span> has released the admit card for the Non Technical Popular Categories NTPC 10+2 Under Graduate Level Post on the official website of RRB. This recruitment was released for 3058 posts. Candidates can also check all the details on the official  website. Applications for the RRB NTPC 10+2 UG Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 28 October 2025, to 04 December 2025. The written examination is going to be conducted on 7, 8, 9 May &amp; 13, 14, 15, 16, 20 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their RRB NTPC 10+2 UG Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RRB NTPC 10+2 UG CBT-I Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB NTPC Graduate Level CEN 07/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong